WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.110
Two unlabelled bottles.

2
00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:05.470
One holds propanal, the other propanone.

3
00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:08.950
Both have the formula C₃H₆O.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.230
You have three techniques to hand: mass
spectrometry, infrared and proton NMR.

5
00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:17.570
Each gives a different kind of clue.

6
00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:21.170
Which spectrum tells the two
bottles apart at a glance?

7
00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:22.230
In this mission,

8
00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:27.270
you'll combine evidence from every technique
into one strategy for finding a structure.

9
00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:30.730
You'll follow a worked example from
the first clue to the final check,

10
00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:33.730
and identify an unknown compound.

11
00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:39.310
Your mission: decide which spectrum tells
propanal and propanone apart, and how.
